# November 19, 2026: Columbia County inland from the Hudson: Claverack, Greenport, Hillsdale, Ancram, Copake Falls,
# Austerlitz and Spencertown, Ghent, Chatham, Kinderhook, Clermont and Livingston. Drawn at random by
# tools/choose.py --state ny (region hud; it offered Ancram, Hurley and Philmont). The Atlas had nothing inland in the
# county but Copake Iron Works. Sources were opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py), and
# through tools/page.py the National Park Service, the Columbia County Historical Society, the Edna St. Vincent Millay
# Society, the Austerlitz Historical Society, the Roeliff Jansen Historical Society, Friends of East Gate, the William
# G. Pomeroy Foundation marker pages, HMdb marker pages, Spencertown Academy, the Crandell Theatre, Bartlett House,
# Bridge Design & Engineering, The Gossips of Rivertown and a 19th-century county history on usgennet.org.
